      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَثَابَرَا</span></b> , (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَثَابَرَتِ الرِّجَالُ</span>, (M,) <i>They two,</i>
(K,) or <i>the men,</i> (M,) <i>leaped,</i> or <i>sprang,</i> (M, K,)
<i>each upon,</i> or <i>at, the other,</i> (K,) or <i>one upon,</i> or
<i>at, another,</i> in war, or fight. (M.)

